{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーい！\n今日もヒナコです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！51回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nサンクエトリストさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/09/2995083/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/09/2995083/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/09/2995083/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はBOMBさんの発売日です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七瀬さん生駒さん飛鳥と私の4人で\n表紙とポスターとグラビアをやらせて\n頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先輩3人と撮影をさせて頂けて\nとても楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、やっぱり自分の力不足というか。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スキルが足りてないのが目に見えて\n痛感して焦りました。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のBOMBさんの撮影では\n可愛くも綺麗にも撮って頂けて\nバレンタインみたいに可愛く撮ってもらえたことと、自分のレベルを痛感し\nレベルアップしていきたい！と\n思えた撮影でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/09/2995083/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/09/2995083/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/09/2995083/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/09/2995083/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"～変化球  へん～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  やさかずさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんが好きな男子の仕草ってなんですかー？？？？\n僕は女子が髪を耳にかける仕草が大好きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎うーん、なんだろう。考えたことなかったなー。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、感情を素直に出せる人がいいな！\n例えば照れてるなら照れてるのがわかっちゃうような人！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(28)  黒石 しょうちゃんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃん、お疲れ様です！\n筋肉痛治った？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎お疲れ様です！\nだいぶ良くなったよ！！！でも、まだ少し残ってるから気を抜くと少しまだ痛い！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  がいさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎あしゅかわいそうだったよ...ちゃんと慰めてあげた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎飛鳥ちゃんにはプライベートであげるんだもーん！皆さんには何をあげるのかは秘密にしておく٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  デコポンさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎変化球と言えば野球で覚えた変化球どんなのある？"},{"type":"image","src":"cid:F00BC71C6DB65C007C73AE93CC3AACD5-04@decoMailer","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎カーブ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(450)  30年ぶりの青春さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎ひなちまとの「ひなこなひ」もなかなかいいですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎なかなかいいでしょー♪\nひなこなひ！！！\nにな(ひなちま)とは\n日奈っていう漢字も同じだから\n漢字にしても日奈子奈日で、いいかんじ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(717)  たけぴょん！！さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎朝から旅行の準備でバタバタでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎旅行！！！いいなー！\nどこに行くんですかー？\n旅行したいなー♪楽しんでくださいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(750)  ハンガーラックと猫足こんぶさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎先週大学入試があったのですぐにコメントできなかったのですが、きいちゃんが目の前の流れ星を掴むまでずっと応援してます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎大学入試お疲れ様でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても、嬉しいです！これからも頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"～見えないもの   へん～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  匿名さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎俺もバレンタイン欲しいなぁ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎しょうがないな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレンタインの日のブログに\nバレンタインっぽいブログ書くね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(29)  タカヒーローさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎見えないものを見ようとして、望遠鏡を覗き込んだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎まさにそれですね！！！\n久しぶりにききたくなっちゃった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  なりけんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんが、\n絶対合格して握手会来てね！\nとか言ってくれたら、合格するしかなくなるのになー、でも言われてないからなー、合格できるかなー(・ω・)\nてか、言ってくれないかなー？ｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎そんな人任せにしちゃいけないですよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、しょうがない！\n仕方がないから今日だけだぞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対合格して握手会来てね！待ってるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  しっちさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎いいなーみさ先輩にSっぽいところ見してもらってー\n握手会で頼んだらSっぽいところ見してくれますかね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎いいでしょー♪\nどうでしょうか！！！あなた次第です！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(450)  水の都さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんの写真見たいけど立ち読みでプレイボーイはちょっと勇気がいる～(;´д｀)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎大丈夫だよ！！！堂々と持って堂々としてれば！何にも迷うことなんてないよ！\nだから！さあ！いますぐ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みてほしいなー(ノ_・。)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(717)  りょう003さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎今日は、誰と一緒のお仕事かな？\n今日のアイスは何かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎今日は1人で撮影でした！\nまた、後日はなします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はアイスを2つ食べて\nどっちもチョコとナッツとバニラとクッキー系のアイスです！美味しかった～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(750)  ノザさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎ひなこと海行きたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎いいね！海！夏になったら行きたいな！海！\n江ノ島の海かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/09/2995083/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のヒナセレはこれでおわりです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またあしたー٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/09/2995083/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は夜遅くまで撮影だったので\nヘトヘトです。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、とーーっても楽しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くみなさんにみてほしいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/02/09/2995083/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、今日はこのへんで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさいー！また明日書きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日こそは締めの挨拶も\n選びたいな。。。"}],"source":"archive"}